---
import { techniques } from '../data/content';
---
<section id="tecnicas" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ink py-24 text-white sm:py-28">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-32 right-0 size-96 rounded-full bg-teal/25 blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-32 left-0 size-96 rounded-full bg-gold/15 blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="container-x relative">
    <div class="reveal max-w-2xl">
      <p class="eyebrow !text-teal-2">Nuestras técnicas</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold sm:text-4xl">Dos técnicas, una sola meta: que tu diseño luzca increíble</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-white/65">Según la tela, el color y el tipo de diseño, te recomendamos la técnica que mejor funciona.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      {techniques.map((t, i) => (
        <article class="reveal relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-8 backdrop-blur sm:p-10" style={`--d:${i * 120}ms`}>
          <div class={`absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 ${i === 0 ? 'bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-2 to-navy-2' : 'bg-gradient-to-r from-gold to-gold-2'}`}></div>
          <span class={`font-display text-6xl font-black ${i === 0 ? 'text-teal-2/25' : 'text-gold/25'}`}>0{i + 1}</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold">{t.name}</h3>
          <p class={`mt-2 font-semibold ${i === 0 ? 'text-teal-2' : 'text-gold'}`}>{t.lead}</p>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-white/70">{t.text}</p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/45">Ideal para</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 grid gap-2.5">
            {t.best.map((b) => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-white/85">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class={`mt-0.5 size-5 shrink-0 ${i === 0 ? 'text-teal-2' : 'text-gold'}`} fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5" /></svg>
                {b}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="reveal mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-6 py-4 text-center text-sm text-white/70">
      ¿No sabes cuál elegir? No te preocupes: cuéntanos qué quieres lograr y te asesoramos sin compromiso.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
